oup\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">Logged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">Sanded</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">Planked</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Log\">$1.35/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Sanded\">$18.01/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Planked\">$22.52/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.52.1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">March 15th, 2024</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Status\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Status</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Obtainable</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Spruce</b> is a common tree found abundantly around <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a>. It is identified by its less-saturated brown bark and dark green leaves. It takes on a tall and slender shape, standing about 35–40 studs tall, making it one of the tallest trees. Its trunk stands tall and thin, nearly completely uncurved, but its leaves span out far, making the whole of the tree quite wide compared to most others.\n</p><p>The normal barked tree sells for around <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$1.5</span> per stud, but its sell price increases to <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$22.5</span> per stud when sanded, and <span style=\"color:#1dab6f;\">$25</span> per stud when planked.\n</p><p>As with any other material in the game, logged, sanded, and planked Spruce can be used to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Textures\">Textures</span></h2>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"6790e78ae0891f7b957e65f57c9046c3\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Spruce-logged-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:97px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Spruce-logged.png\" title=\"Spruce-logged.png (14 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:97px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/da/Spruce-logged.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/97?cb=20240316024629\" title=\"Spruce-logged.png (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"100\" width=\"98\" data-image-name=\"Spruce-logged.png\" data-image-key=\"Spruce-logged.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Spruce-logged.png (14 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Log\" height=\"100\" width=\"98\" data-image-name=\"Spruce-logged.png\" data-image-key=\"Spruce-logged.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Log\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/da/Spruce-logged.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/97?cb=20240316024629\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:100px;\">Log</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Image_2024-03-15_195147246-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:99px; width:100px; top:0.5px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Image_2024-03-15_195147246.png\" title=\"Image 2024-03-15 195147246.png (15 KB)\" style=\"height:99px; width:100px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a9/Image_2024-03-15_195147246.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240316025203\" title=\"Image 2024-03-15 195147246.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Image 2024-03-15 195147246.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2024-03-15_195147246.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Image 2024-03-15 195147246.png (15 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Sanded\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Image 2024-03-15 195147246.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2024-03-15_195147246.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Sanded\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/a/a9/Image_2024-03-15_195147246.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240316025203\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:100px;\">Sanded</div></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:102px; \"><div class=\"thumb\" style=\"height:102px;\"><div class=\"gallery-image-wrapper accent\" id=\"Image_2024-03-15_195239332-png\" style=\"position: relative; height:100px; width:100px;\"><a class=\"image lightbox\" href=\"/wiki/File:Image_2024-03-15_195239332.png\" title=\"Image 2024-03-15 195239332.png (23 KB)\" style=\"height:100px; width:100px;\"><noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8e/Image_2024-03-15_195239332.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240316025251\" title=\"Image 2024-03-15 195239332.png (23 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Image 2024-03-15 195239332.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2024-03-15_195239332.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\"></noscript><img style=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" title=\"Image 2024-03-15 195239332.png (23 KB)\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" alt=\"Planked\" height=\"100\" width=\"100\" data-image-name=\"Image 2024-03-15 195239332.png\" data-image-key=\"Image_2024-03-15_195239332.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-caption=\"Planked\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8e/Image_2024-03-15_195239332.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/100?cb=20240316025251\" /></a></div></div><div class=\"lightbox-caption\" style=\"width:100px;\">Planked</div></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Spruce has a similar appearance to the <a href=\"/wiki/Blue_Pine\" title=\"Blue Pine\">Blue Pine</a>, but it is much shorter and has a darker brown bark.</li></ul>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%;